{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements a C-based library for handling YAML configuration data using the libfyaml library. It provides functions for creating, opening (from file or memory), closing, and extracting various data types (string, bool, integers, floating points) from YAML documents. It also supports advanced features such as including external files or URLs (via curl), merging YAML nodes, and processing include directives within YAML nodes. The code handles nested includes with a maximum depth and performs document merging, making it suitable for configuration management or similar applications requiring YAML processing with include and merge support.", "external_files": ["<ut_kvp.h>", "<ut_log.h>", "<libfyaml.h>", "<curl/curl.h>"], "external_methods": ["fy_document_build_from_file", "fy_document_build_from_malloc_string", "fy_document_resolve", "fy_document_destroy", "fy_document_create", "fy_document_set_root", "fy_emit_document_to_string", "fy_node_copy", "fy_node_create_sequence", "fy_node_sequence_iterate", "fy_node_sequence_append", "fy_node_create_mapping", "fy_node_mapping_iterate", "fy_node_mapping_lookup_by_string", "fy_node_mapping_append", "fy_node_insert", "fy_node_is_scalar", "fy_node_get_tag", "fy_node_get_scalar", "fy_node_get_scalar_length", "fy_node_copy", "fy_node_create_scalar_copy", "fy_node_is_sequence", "fy_node_is_mapping", "fy_node_pair_key", "fy_node_pair_value", "fy_node_by_path"], "published": ["ut_kvp_createInstance", "ut_kvp_destroyInstance", "ut_kvp_open", "ut_kvp_openMemory", "ut_kvp_close", "ut_kvp_getData", "ut_kvp_getField", "ut_kvp_getBoolField", "ut_kvp_getUInt8Field", "ut_kvp_getUInt16Field", "ut_kvp_getUInt32Field", "ut_kvp_getUInt64Field", "ut_kvp_getFloatField", "ut_kvp_getDoubleField", "ut_kvp_fieldPresent", "ut_kvp_getStringField", "ut_kvp_getListCount", "ut_kvp_getDataBytes"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "ut_kvp_instance_t * ut_kvp_createInstance(void)", "description